body:
Part of #1509.

The maintainer on #1509 (2026-11-13): "The trochoidal is a roughing strategy that should be selectable as a way of clearing a pocket, slot or other bulk of material. Anywhere where we can use Adaptive, the option to "tick" trochoidal should also exist."

What the first slice of #1509 does: the Trochoidal method of 2D Adaptive cuts ONE lane of loops along the region's medial line (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs`), with the loop band the least clearance along that line. It is confined to the region and judged by the same laws as every operation. What it cannot do yet is refused by name or said in the notes:

- a region with no single medial line (branches: L, T, a pocket with an island) is refused: "the area is no single channel ... use the Spiral method for this region";
- a ring round an island (a closed medial line) is refused: "the region closes round an island";
- a region where one lane would leave more than 25 % out of reach is refused (a triangle, a wide area with a narrow neck);
- under 25 % the unreached area (the corners of a rectangular pocket: 9 % on the 34 x 16 pin) is only said in the notes, in mm2 and per cent - nothing cuts it.

Wanted: the Trochoidal method clears any region the Spiral method clears.

Open design (why this is effort:max): several lanes over a wide region (direction, spacing and lane-to-lane engagement, each lane a band inside the eroded area so confinement stays by construction and by the path check), closed lanes round islands (the loop layout's crossing law on a closed centre line), branches, and a wall / corner pass for what the loops cannot reach, held to the engagement limit. The in-planner trochoid of the HSM plan (`adaptive::troch_plan`, #5) is still blocked on #47 (returns land in cut); this issue does not depend on it.

Done means: an L-shaped pocket, a pocket with an island and a wide rectangular pocket each generate under Method = Trochoidal, stay inside the region (the path check and the post's stock sim), read within the engagement limit, and leave no more than the HSM plan's rest share; golden CL for each; the refusals that remain are by name.
